[I] Wrangling Untrusted File Formats Safely, single-file C library

[T] Wuffs is a memory-safe library for decoding image and other file formats,
[T] shipped as a single C file compiled into the including program, used by
[T] ladybird.

[U] https://github.com/google/wuffs

[A] Nigel Tao
[M] The T2 Project <t2@t2-project.org>

[C] extra/development
[F] CROSS

[L] APL
